#. front matter: title
#: site/under-the-hood.md:2 site/under-the-hood.md:5
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Анимации"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:7
msgid "Step-by-step animations that show what Python does **under the hood**: what a variable really is, and in which order an expression is calculated."
msgstr "Анимации стъпка по стъпка, които показват какво прави Python **\"под капака\"**: какво всъщност е една променлива и в какъв ред се изчислява един израз."

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:10
msgid "Each animation has several **scenarios** (tabs at the top). A link below opens one scenario in a new tab."
msgstr "Всяка анимация има няколко **сценария** (табовете най-горе). Връзка отдолу отваря един сценарий в нов таб."

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:13
msgid "**Next step:** Right arrow or `Space`. **Back:** Left arrow. **Start:** `Home`. **Auto-play:** `P`."
msgstr "**Следваща стъпка:** стрелка надясно или `Space`. **Назад:** стрелка наляво. **Към началото:** `Home`. **Автоматично:** `P`."

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:15
msgid "`file.html#3` opens scenario 3, `file.html#3.5` opens scenario 3 at step 5."
msgstr "`file.html#3` отваря сценарий 3, `file.html#3.5` отваря сценарий 3 на стъпка 5."

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:16
msgid "Scenarios marked **advanced** go deeper."
msgstr "Сценариите, отбелязани с **за напреднали**, навлизат по-надълбоко."

#. box title
#: site/under-the-hood.md:18
msgid "English and Bulgarian"
msgstr "На английски и на български"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:19
msgid "Every animation is in English and in Bulgarian. The **EN / BG** button at the top of an animation switches the language and keeps the current step."
msgstr "Всяка анимация е на английски и на български. Бутонът **EN / BG** най-горе в анимацията сменя езика и запазва текущата стъпка."

#. heading 2
#: site/under-the-hood.md:23
msgid "Session 1 - Introduction, syntax, data types and variables"
msgstr "Занятие 1 - Въведение, синтаксис, типове данни и променливи"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:25
msgid "**[Names and objects](animations/namesAndObjects.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - a variable is a name bound to an object; assignment, a new value, two names for one object, `x = x + 1`, dynamic typing, `is` and `==`. [1. A name and an object](animations/namesAndObjects.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. A new value](animations/namesAndObjects.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. Two names, one object](animations/namesAndObjects.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `x = x + 1`](animations/namesAndObjects.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Types belong to objects](animations/namesAndObjects.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. Several names at once](animations/namesAndObjects.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}, [7. `is` and `==` (advanced)](animations/namesAndObjects.html#7){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Имена и обекти](animations/namesAndObjects.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - променливата е име, свързано с обект; присвояване, нова стойност, две имена за един обект, `x = x + 1`, динамично типизиране, `is` и `==`. [1. Име и обект](animations/namesAndObjects.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Нова стойност](animations/namesAndObjects.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. Две имена, един обект](animations/namesAndObjects.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `x = x + 1`](animations/namesAndObjects.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Типът е на обекта](animations/namesAndObjects.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. Няколко имена наведнъж](animations/namesAndObjects.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}, [7. `is` и `==` (за напреднали)](animations/namesAndObjects.html#7){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:36
msgid "**[How an expression is evaluated](animations/expressionEvaluation.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - the order of operations, step by step, with the table of priorities. [1. Precedence](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Brackets](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `**` and minus](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `//` and `%`](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Chained comparisons](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. `and` / `or`](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}, [7. Mixed types](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#7){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Как се изчислява израз](animations/expressionEvaluation.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - редът на операциите, стъпка по стъпка, с таблицата на приоритетите. [1. Приоритет](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Скоби](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `**` и минус](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `//` и `%`](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Верига от сравнения](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. `and` / `or`](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}, [7. Смесени типове](animations/expressionEvaluation.html#7){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. heading 2
#: site/under-the-hood.md:46
msgid "Session 2 - Conditional statements and loops"
msgstr "Занятие 2 - Условни конструкции и цикли"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:48
msgid "**[Loops step by step](animations/loopTrace.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - the variables, the test and the output of `if` / `elif` / `else`, `for`, `while`, `break` and `continue`, one line at a time. [1. `for` with an accumulator](animations/loopTrace.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Decisions in a loop](animations/loopTrace.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `while`: repay a loan](animations/loopTrace.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `break`: stop at the first](animations/loopTrace.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. `continue`: skip a record](animations/loopTrace.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. `for` - `else` (advanced)](animations/loopTrace.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Циклите стъпка по стъпка](animations/loopTrace.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - променливите, проверката и изходът на `if` / `elif` / `else`, `for`, `while`, `break` и `continue`, ред по ред. [1. `for` с акумулатор](animations/loopTrace.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Решения в цикъл](animations/loopTrace.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `while`: погасяване на кредит](animations/loopTrace.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `break`: спрете при първия](animations/loopTrace.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. `continue`: прескачане на запис](animations/loopTrace.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. `for` - `else` (за напреднали)](animations/loopTrace.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. heading 2
#: site/under-the-hood.md:58
msgid "Session 3 - Lists (basics), tuples and sets"
msgstr "Занятие 3 - Lists (основи), tuples и sets"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:60
msgid "**[Lists and references](animations/listsAndReferences.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - a list changes in place; two names for one list; copies; `sort()` and `sorted()`; tuples that cannot change. [1. A list changes in place](animations/listsAndReferences.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Two names, one list](animations/listsAndReferences.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. A copy](animations/listsAndReferences.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `sort()` and `sorted()`](animations/listsAndReferences.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. A tuple cannot change](animations/listsAndReferences.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. A list inside a tuple (advanced)](animations/listsAndReferences.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Lists и референции](animations/listsAndReferences.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - list се променя на място; две имена за един list; копия; `sort()` и `sorted()`; tuples, които не могат да се променят. [1. List се променя на място](animations/listsAndReferences.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Две имена, един list](animations/listsAndReferences.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. Копие](animations/listsAndReferences.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. `sort()` и `sorted()`](animations/listsAndReferences.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Tuple не може да се променя](animations/listsAndReferences.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. List вътре в tuple (за напреднали)](animations/listsAndReferences.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. heading 2
#: site/under-the-hood.md:70
msgid "Session 4 - Functions"
msgstr "Занятие 4 - Функции"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:72
msgid "**[Function calls step by step](animations/functionCalls.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - each call gets a frame with its local names; `return`; local and global names; calls in calls; a list passed to a function. [1. A call and a return](animations/functionCalls.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Local and global](animations/functionCalls.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `UnboundLocalError`](animations/functionCalls.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. A function calls a function](animations/functionCalls.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. A list passed to a function](animations/functionCalls.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. A list as a default value (advanced)](animations/functionCalls.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Извиквания на функции стъпка по стъпка](animations/functionCalls.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - всяко извикване получава frame със своите локални имена; `return`; локални и глобални имена; извиквания в извиквания; list, подаден на функция. [1. Извикване и връщане](animations/functionCalls.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Локално и глобално](animations/functionCalls.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. `UnboundLocalError`](animations/functionCalls.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. Функция извиква функция](animations/functionCalls.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. List, подаден на функция](animations/functionCalls.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}, [6. List като стойност по подразбиране (за напреднали)](animations/functionCalls.html#6){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. heading 2
#: site/under-the-hood.md:82
msgid "Session 6 - Dictionaries"
msgstr "Занятие 6 - Dictionaries"

#. paragraph
#: site/under-the-hood.md:84
msgid "**[Grouping by hand](animations/groupingByHand.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - a dictionary as a lookup table, and as the result of a `GROUP BY` that grows row by row: a lookup with a default, counting with `get`, sums with `defaultdict`, groups of rows in lists, and a join by key. [1. A lookup](animations/groupingByHand.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Count with `get`](animations/groupingByHand.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. Sum with `defaultdict`](animations/groupingByHand.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. Group into lists](animations/groupingByHand.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. The join by key](animations/groupingByHand.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**[Групиране на ръка](animations/groupingByHand.html){target=\"_blank\"}** - dictionary като таблица за търсене (lookup table) и като резултат от `GROUP BY`, който расте ред по ред: търсене със стойност по подразбиране, броене с `get`, суми с `defaultdict`, групи от редове в lists и join по ключ. [1. Търсене](animations/groupingByHand.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Броене с `get`](animations/groupingByHand.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. Сума с `defaultdict`](animations/groupingByHand.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. Групиране в lists](animations/groupingByHand.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Join по ключ](animations/groupingByHand.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}"
